LOADFIL1 package version 1.0.0.0.5 / 2026-09-16
Based on LoadFile.S Version 0.8 / 1996-07-01.
Updated for Win32 TSE with loadfil1.dll; the obsolete
setDTA(), intr(), and FindFirst() calls were removed.
The DLL interface uses only parameterless integer calls and
does not write into TSE SAL string memory.
Main() now activates the hooks. A guard prevents duplicate
hook installation if the macro is executed more than once.
Custom prompt and picker footers are applied by a queued
internal key after newer TSE versions draw their defaults.
The complete old footer is cleared first. English is now
the default language; define _GER to build German prompts.
This macro modifies all file entry dialog boxes, providing
- a footer line showing command keys
- a pick file box
- another pick box for drives
German and english version provided.

No special preparations to the user interface are neccessary because all
functions hook themselves into the appropriate events, making the
macro's workings fully transparent. The additional features will be
available automatically upon installation. The pick file list will
always start up in the directory where the current file resides, or the
current directory for the drive, if no file is given.
